<!--
  Example EMS: a SmartGridready connection point (SGCP) over REST.

  The contract of the reference EMS the bench tests itself against
  (tests/fake_ems.py): UniDirFlexLoadMgmt 2m, FlexMgmt 4m (GetSettings and
  RestrictPower) and Metering ActivePowerAC, a Bearer session obtained with an
  API key, and written values carried as query parameters, because
  sgr-commhandler up to 0.5.2 never sends the body of a write call.

  An example to copy and adapt, not a declared product: release Draft,
  testState None.
-->
